OL,3,GNEWSADo you know what 'out ER' signs
OL,4,Amean?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEver driven past an 'out ER' sign in
OL,7,FLincolnshire and wondered what it
OL,8,Fmeans?
OL,10,FOne might assume they point motorists
OL,11,Fin the direction of a hospital or other
OL,12,Fmedical facility.
OL,14,FHowever, they actually mark safe
OL,15,Fevacuation routes in the event of
OL,16,Fextreme events such as flooding.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
