OL,3,GNEWSADo you know what 'out ER' signs
OL,4,Amean?
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief Fire Officer Mark Baxter, who
OL,7,Falso chairs the Lincolnshire Resilience
OL,8,FForum, said: "This is just one tool in
OL,9,Four armoury to be able to support the
OL,10,Fevacuations of large amounts of
OL,11,Fpeople."
